==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
In {{BotW}}, Lizalfos Tails are [[Material]]s that can be dropped by [[Blue Lizalfos]] and [[Black Lizalfos]]. They are highly valued as ingredients in [[Elixir]]s due to their ability to continue wriggling after being severed from their body.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Lizalfos Tails can be exchanged for 12 [[Mon]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] or sold for 28 [[Rupee]]s. They can also be used to make [[Green Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

[[Great Fairy|Great Fairies]] can use Lizalfos Tails to enhance the [[Soldier's Set]] and [[Zora Set]].
{{Material Armors|BotW|Lizalfos Tail}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
Lizalfos Tails are dropped by standard [[Lizalfos]]. They can be [[Cooking|Cooked]] into [[Elixir]]s and used for [[Enhancing|Upgrading]] pieces of [[Armor]]. They may also be [[Fuse]]d to [[Weapon]]s to grant them whip-like properties.

Lizalfos Tails are required to Enhance the following pieces of Armor at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|TotK|Lizalfos Tail}}

